BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; (</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2011년도 이후 입학자 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 재학 중 해외저명학술지에 1편 이상 주저자로 게재 또는 국내 전국규모</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">학술지에 2편 중 1편이상은 주저자로 게재된 논문)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; ※ 학술대회 발표 논문은 게재물이 아니므로 제출 시 확인 후 제출 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 나. 게재된 경우 : 논문 별쇄본 1부.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(별쇄본 외 복사본 제출 불가합니다.)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 다. 게재 예정인 경우 : 게재(예정)증명서 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 1.6pt\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp